{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "minecraft": "1.21.11",
  "control": {
    "endpoint_env": "NATIVE_TRIAL_CONTROL",
    "framing": "one JSON object per line; maximum 4096 bytes including newline",
    "request_fields": ["schema_version", "run_id", "trial_id", "case_id", "request_id", "phase", "game_port", "action_elapsed_ms"],
    "reply_fields": ["schema_version", "run_id", "trial_id", "case_id", "request_id", "phase", "status"],
    "reply_status": "ready",
    "setup_timeout_ms": 60000,
    "readiness_timeout_ms": 5000,
    "notes": [
      "Controller acknowledgement never substitutes for received-state readiness or operation admission.",
      "One private loopback endpoint and isolated world per trial invocation; run_id is generated by the test and must be echoed.",
      "Region order is overlay order, inclusive bounds. Movement preserves placements and pose between cases; no reset or teleport after initial setup.",
      "Movement wall is the two dirt placements at x=4; predicted wall gate may confirm/install the same cells only.",
      "Inventory describes the only supplied main inventory items; all other main inventory slots are empty.",
      "External air/stone is one batch, strictly before 3000ms from mining start; no intermediate air receipt required.",
      "No edits between recovery and replacement verification. Nine-second windows and action offsets remain trial evidence bounds.",
      "Setup requests use phase=setup; the only later phases are the permitted_external_edits entries. Replies echo all identity fields and phase, with status=ready; extra reply fields are rejected.",
      "Healthy loaded non-OP survival profiles, normal standing pose and dry ground are required. Server/world/process ownership belongs to the later controller PR; this fixture does not certify isolation.",
      "Readiness failures are JSON records on test stderr with run_id, case_id and missing_predicates; successful trial evidence includes the control identity."
    ]
  },
  "trials": [
